# Ore-Rich Stalactite // Cosmium Catalyst. The Stalactite's {R}, spent only on instant and sorcery spells, pays for Lightning
# Bolts. "Craft with four or more red instant and/or sorcery cards {3}{R}{R}" (CR 702.167a-b) takes cards from the
# graveyard alone: with three Bolts there it is not offered (refused); with four it is, and all four are exiled. Cosmium
# Catalyst's "{1}{R}, {T}: Choose an exiled card used to craft this artifact at random. You may cast that card without
# paying its mana cost" picks one of them (the die says the second) and Bot1 casts it for nothing at Bot2 (CR 702.167c,
# 608.2g); on turn eleven Bot1 declines to cast the one it picks. A Phyrexian Metamorph copying the Catalyst has its
# ability but no cards used to craft it: activated, it chooses nothing and casts nothing.

